          "y": 352,
          "w": 253,
          "h": 40,
          "text": "Menu board: tick dishes, star one, or list by stock. Joe Wild sells a promotional poster for 500 credits, bringing one more courier.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "菜单板勾选上架、打星，或按库存一键上架。王尔德处花 500 信用点买宣传图，每天多来一位骑手。"
          },
          "style": "body"
