          "h": 30,
          "text": "Cooked but unbagged food sells to the Lower Levels and Eleanor, and Serpico takes it.",
          "translations": {
            "zh": "做好没打包的菜，可以卖给下层区和埃利诺，也能送塞尔皮斯。"
          },
          "style": "body"
